  "question": {
    "text": "An integer is chosen at random from the integers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>50</mn></math>. The probability that the chosen integer is a multiple of atleast one of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>14</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, the probability of choosing a number which is a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Similarly, the probability of choosing a number which is a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And the probability of choosing a number which is a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Also, the probability of choosing a number which is a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mn>6</mn></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∩</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And the probability of choosing a number which is a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mn>7</mn></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>∩</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And the probability of choosing a number which is a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mn>7</mn></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∩</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And finally, the probability of choosing a number which is a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>6</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mn>7</mn></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∩</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>∩</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∪</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>∪</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∪</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>∪</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}